    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Daffy Fish, where you play as a happy flying fish that must make his way through a number of challenging levels, collecting goodies and avoiding dangers on the way to the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed in the old-school arcade style of play you can select from 3 modes from Easy, Medium and Hard to challenge yourself and friends to see who can make it the farthest and score the most points. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 20 challenging levels to enjoy that will take you through the Caribbean Islands, Pyramids of Egypt, The Icy Artic and Lava World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just remember as you play that water is life to Daffy Fish, so don\u2019t stay out of the water too long.<br><br>(<strong>Steam Deck Compatible</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Enjoy :-)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Daffy Fish, where you play as a happy flying fish that must make his way through a number of challenging levels, collecting goodies and avoiding dangers on the way to the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed in the old-school arcade style of play you can select from 3 modes from Easy, Medium and Hard to challenge yourself and friends to see who can make it the farthest and score the most points. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 20 challenging levels to enjoy that will take you through the Caribbean Islands, Pyramids of Egypt, The Icy Artic and Lava World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just remember as you play that water is life to Daffy Fish, so don\u2019t stay out of the water too long.<br><br>(<strong>Steam Deck Compatible</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Enjoy :-)</p>",
